# --- TUY CHON ---
# Mau URL cho nut "Bieu do". {sym} = ma chung khoan.
# De trong = https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol={sym}
# Doi de thu dang link nao mo duoc app TradingView tren may cua ban, vd:
#   https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/{sym}/
# KHONG dat tradingview://... vao day: Telegram chi nhan http(s):// va tg://
# nen API se tu choi ca tin nhan. Xem README muc 6.
